message: "Cite this research preprint for the explicit four-qubit C3 certificate, and cite Jonah for the original question and spectral framework."
title: "Cospectral Pauli carriers with different completion spectra: an exact four-qubit C3 certificate"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Donahue
    given-names: "Alexander S."
