url: "https://0thernes.github.io/hoggar-bound-lab/paper/c3-spectral-counterexample.pdf"
abstract: >-
  Two explicit sign assignments on a 71-point real four-qubit Pauli section
  have identical carrier characteristic polynomials and distinct completion
  cubic traces, 14976 and 15360. The certificate establishes the four-qubit C3
  instance of the strict-law failure predicted by Jonah's Conjecture E.
  Exact integer checks, Lean source, an Eshkol execution record and an
  interactive BigInt verifier accompany the proof. This is an AI-assisted
  research preprint, not peer reviewed; no all-dimension or historical-priority
  claim is made.
keywords:
  - Pauli contextuality
  - cospectral matrices
  - hyperplane completion
  - Lean 4
  - exact certificate
